== 3. where the verdict actually is ==
   The route answers "pending" and hands the work to a background worker, so success is the
   ABSENCE of a log line. In the harness PDS output:

     success — no "notify relay job failed"
     failure — "notify relay job failed" plus the reason. "relay refused enrollment: Denied"
               means the code was unknown, spent, or expired (one shape for all three).

